#. Plugin name — proper noun, normally left untranslated.
#: includes/class-yk-wcgv-settings.php:191
#: includes/class-yk-wcgv-settings.php:192
#: includes/class-yk-wcgv-settings.php:252
msgid "YK Grid Variations"
msgstr "YK Grid Variations"

#: includes/class-yk-wcgv-settings.php:253
msgid ""
"Controls what is displayed on WooCommerce category, archive, and "
"single product pages."
msgstr ""
"Contrôle ce qui est affiché sur les pages catégorie, archive et "
"produit de WooCommerce."

#: includes/class-yk-wcgv-settings.php:258
msgid "Product Cards"
msgstr "Fiches produit"

#: includes/class-yk-wcgv-settings.php:259
msgid "Applies to archive and category pages."
msgstr "S’applique aux pages archive et catégorie."

#: includes/class-yk-wcgv-settings.php:264
msgid "Sale badge"
msgstr "Badge promotion"

#: includes/class-yk-wcgv-settings.php:269
msgid "Show SALE badge on discounted products"
msgstr "Afficher le badge SALE sur les produits en promotion"

#. Settings row label for the product item number.
#: includes/class-yk-wcgv-settings.php:275
msgid "SKU"
msgstr "Réf. article"

#: includes/class-yk-wcgv-settings.php:280
msgid "Display item number / SKU beneath the product title"
msgstr "Afficher la référence / le SKU sous le titre du produit"

#: includes/class-yk-wcgv-settings.php:286
msgid "Variation swatches &amp; pills"
msgstr "Pastilles &amp; puces de variation"

#: includes/class-yk-wcgv-settings.php:291
msgid "Show variation swatches and pills on category pages"
msgstr ""
"Afficher les pastilles et les puces de variation sur les pages "
"catégorie"

#: includes/class-yk-wcgv-settings.php:294
msgid ""
"Every attribute marked \"Used for variations\" on the product is shown "
"automatically, in the order set there."
msgstr ""
"Chaque attribut coché « Utilisé pour les variations » sur le produit "
"est affiché automatiquement, dans l’ordre défini à cet endroit."

#: includes/class-yk-wcgv-settings.php:300
msgid "Quantity stepper"
msgstr "Sélecteur de quantité"

#: includes/class-yk-wcgv-settings.php:305
msgid "Show +/− quantity stepper on product cards"
msgstr "Afficher le sélecteur de quantité +/− sur les fiches produit"

#: includes/class-yk-wcgv-settings.php:312
msgid "Archive paging"
msgstr "Pagination des archives"

#: includes/class-yk-wcgv-settings.php:314
msgid ""
"Individual categories can override this on their own edit screen "
"(Products → Categories)."
msgstr ""
"Chaque catégorie peut remplacer ce réglage sur son propre écran "
"d’édition (Produits → Catégories)."

#: includes/class-yk-wcgv-settings.php:320
msgid "Mode"
msgstr "Mode"

#: includes/class-yk-wcgv-settings.php:324
msgid "Pagination (WooCommerce links)"
msgstr "Pagination (liens WooCommerce)"

#: includes/class-yk-wcgv-settings.php:334
msgid "Prefetch distance"
msgstr "Distance de préchargement"

#: includes/class-yk-wcgv-settings.php:340
msgid ""
"How far before the end of the list the next page starts loading. "
"Raise it on slower servers so shoppers never see a spinner."
msgstr ""
"À quelle distance de la fin de la liste la page suivante commence à "
"se charger. À augmenter sur les serveurs lents pour qu’aucun "
"visiteur ne voie de spinner."

#: includes/class-yk-wcgv-settings.php:347
msgid "Theme style variation"
msgstr "Variante de style du thème"

#: includes/class-yk-wcgv-settings.php:349
msgid ""
"WordPress does not record which style variation is active, so it has "
"to be selected here. The choice only adds a body class — it does not "
"switch the variation itself."
msgstr ""
"WordPress n’enregistre nulle part quelle variante de style est "
"active : elle doit donc être sélectionnée ici. Ce choix ajoute "
"uniquement une classe sur l’élément body, il ne change pas la "
"variante elle-même."

#: includes/class-yk-wcgv-settings.php:355
msgid "Active variation"
msgstr "Variante active"

#: includes/class-yk-wcgv-settings.php:359
msgid "The active theme ships no style variations."
msgstr "Le thème actif ne fournit aucune variante de style."

#: includes/class-yk-wcgv-settings.php:367
msgid "— None —"
msgstr "— Aucune —"

#. translators: %s: generated CSS body class, e.g. yk-variant-shop-attack
#: includes/class-yk-wcgv-settings.php:380
msgid ""
"Adds %s to the body element, so the plugin stylesheet can override "
"its --yk-* design tokens for this variation."
msgstr ""
"Ajoute %s à l’élément body, afin que la feuille de style de "
"l’extension puisse surcharger ses jetons de design --yk-* pour cette "
"variante."

#: includes/class-yk-wcgv-settings.php:384
msgid ""
"Adds a body.yk-variant-* class so the plugin stylesheet can override "
"its --yk-* design tokens for this variation."
msgstr ""
"Ajoute une classe body.yk-variant-* afin que la feuille de style de "
"l’extension puisse surcharger ses jetons de design --yk-* pour cette "
"variante."

#: includes/class-yk-wcgv-settings.php:394
msgid "Single Product Page"
msgstr "Page produit"

#: includes/class-yk-wcgv-settings.php:399
msgid "Enhanced variation UI"
msgstr "Interface de variation améliorée"

#: includes/class-yk-wcgv-settings.php:404
msgid ""
"Replace variation dropdowns with swatches/pills and add +/− quantity "
"stepper"
msgstr ""
"Remplacer les listes déroulantes de variation par des "
"pastilles/puces et ajouter le sélecteur de quantité +/−"

#: includes/class-yk-wcgv-term-meta.php:105
msgid "Select swatch image"
msgstr "Sélectionner l’image de la pastille"

#: includes/class-yk-wcgv-term-meta.php:106
msgid "Use this image"
msgstr "Utiliser cette image"

#: includes/class-yk-wcgv-term-meta.php:120
#: includes/class-yk-wcgv-term-meta.php:142
